{"3590370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Insanitation", "steam_appid": 3590370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590370/extras/bb896fae43fa149227ac4e6c1840b47a.avif?t=1784247031\" width=211 height=211 /></span><strong>ATTENTION! This is the Director speaking.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome cadets and kittens to <strong>Insanitation</strong>. Here at CSP you will fight and <strong>strive to</strong> <strong>create Order or Chaos by any means necessary</strong>. No kibble too dry and no mop too wet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle in a head to head competition against up to 4 family members or friends where it's Cats VS Keepers. You decide the difficulty as you battle your way through houses and restaurants alike. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight clean, play dirty!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create <strong>Order</strong> As A <strong>Keeper</strong>  :</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an agent of <strong>ORDER</strong> your task is to keep the area assigned to you as neat and tidy as it was built and designed ( if you can ).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590370/extras/f2387ec87d3b0773c61c4a68810582d7.avif?t=1784247031\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590370/extras_big/f2387ec87d3b0773c61c4a68810582d7.avif?t=1784247031 width=800 height=340 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create <strong>Chaos</strong> As A <strong>Cat</strong>  :</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an agent of <strong>CHAOS</strong> your task is to keep the area assigned to you as disgustingly dirty as possible, wreaking havoc wherever your paws take you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590370/extras/Cat-Jumping.png?t=1784247031\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Clean Or Destroy 5 Crazy Chaotically Fun Maps</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map has been designed to offer a new challenge to face or create. Ranging from a <strong>Crazy Cat Lady's Apartment</strong>, a &quot;relaxed&quot; cozy <strong>Cat Cafe Restaurant</strong>, or an &quot;average&quot; <strong>Home</strong> <strong>Insanitation</strong> has it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590370/extras/33514d860ac8a850da22e45197632948.poster.avif?t=1784247031\" width=710 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590370/extras/33514d860ac8a850da22e45197632948.webm?t=1784247031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590370/extras/33514d860ac8a850da22e45197632948.mp4?t=1784247031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590370/extras/bb896fae43fa149227ac4e6c1840b47a.avif?t=1784247031\" width=211 height=211 /></span><strong>ATTENTION! This is the Director speaking.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome cadets and kittens to <strong>Insanitation</strong>. Here at CSP you will fight and <strong>strive to</strong> <strong>create Order or Chaos by any means necessary</strong>. No kibble too dry and no mop too wet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle in a head to head competition against up to 4 family members or friends where it's Cats VS Keepers. You decide the difficulty as you battle your way through houses and restaurants alike. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight clean, play dirty!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create <strong>Order</strong> As A <strong>Keeper</strong>  :</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an agent of <strong>ORDER</strong> your task is to keep the area assigned to you as neat and tidy as it was built and designed ( if you can ).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590370/extras/f2387ec87d3b0773c61c4a68810582d7.avif?t=1784247031\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590370/extras_big/f2387ec87d3b0773c61c4a68810582d7.avif?t=1784247031 width=800 height=340 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create <strong>Chaos</strong> As A <strong>Cat</strong>  :</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an agent of <strong>CHAOS</strong> your task is to keep the area assigned to you as disgustingly dirty as possible, wreaking havoc wherever your paws take you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590370/extras/Cat-Jumping.png?t=1784247031\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Clean Or Destroy 5 Crazy Chaotically Fun Maps</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map has been designed to offer a new challenge to face or create. Ranging from a <strong>Crazy Cat Lady's Apartment</strong>, a &quot;relaxed&quot; cozy <strong>Cat Cafe Restaurant</strong>, or an &quot;average&quot; <strong>Home</strong> <strong>Insanitation</strong> has it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><vi